# Environment variables for docker compose (all three stacks: prod / dev / v4).
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values. .env is gitignored — NEVER
# commit it (it carries the real DB password and bank-feed API key).
#
# docker compose reads .env from this directory automatically.

# --- Required ---

# PostgreSQL password for the `fin` user. No default — compose fails fast if
# unset. Rotate with: ALTER USER fin PASSWORD '...'; then `docker compose up -d`.
POSTGRES_PASSWORD=replace-with-strong-password

# --- bank-feed microservice (CR021/CR022) ---
# host.docker.internal resolves to the host (compose files set extra_hosts on
# Linux). Override if bank-feed runs elsewhere.
BANK_FEED_URL=http://host.docker.internal:3007
BANK_FEED_API_KEY=replace-with-bank-feed-api-key

# --- Optional ---

# Local LLM gateway for the AI Review feature (ocr-llm, via Tailscale/LAN).
# LLM_GATEWAY_URL=http://192.168.1.61:8080

# Gateway client key. REQUIRED for AI Review: the gateway has enforced client
# identity since 2026-08-31, so an unkeyed call gets 401 client_unidentified.
# Sent as the X-Client-Id: finance + X-Client-Key PAIR (an id alone is
# discarded). Issued out of band by ocr-llm — see docs/guides/ocr-llm-integration.md.
# Must also be mapped in the compose `environment:` block to reach the container.
# OCR_LLM_CLIENT_KEY=replace-with-ocr-llm-client-key

# Comma-separated CORS allowlist override (defaults cover dev/prod/Tailscale).
# CORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:5174,https://fin.example.ts.net

# Auto-managed by Scripts/bump-version.sh — safe to leave out initially.
VITE_APP_VERSION=0.0.0

# ── Market data (CR093 — Portfolio X-ray). Host-run scripts only today; if a
# server-side caller is ever added, these must ALSO be mapped in the compose
# `environment:` block — a value in .env alone never reaches a container.

# Tradier brokerage API. Daily price history (/v1/markets/history — measured
# 3,112 bars back to 2014-04-17) and single-name sector
# (/beta/markets/fundamentals/company). ⚠️ Returns NOTHING for funds: asset
# class and sector weights are both null for QQQ and FLDR alike.
# TRADIER_ACCESS_TOKEN=replace-with-tradier-access-token

# Financial Modeling Prep. ETF/fund sector weights — the one requirement Tradier
# cannot serve. ~28 calls per refresh against a 250/day free tier.
# FMP_API_KEY=replace-with-fmp-api-key
